  "story": {
    "day": 126,
    "title": "Kaya's Special Day",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya, a junior high school student, went out on the twelfth.",
      "She went to the department store for her own project.",
      "On the fourteenth floor, she bought a cake to carry.",
      "She did not drop it, and her mom said, \"Don't lose it!\"",
      "Kaya took a public bus away to join a volunteer tour at the nursing home.",
      "An interviewer asked about her country; she gave a good answer.",
      "She did not forget the interviewer's kind face.",
      "In the living room, an old man held a Brown Bear.",
      "After a break, Kaya looked for a roasted sweet potato.",
      "Finally, she went home, changed her jeans for shorts.",
      "She wanted to lie on the sofa and read about a wolf.",
      "She took a bath, then would sleep, dreaming of skate."
    ]
  }
